      "day": 1,
      "subject": "Welcome to the No Blue Sky series — {{company}}",
      "body": "Hi {{name}},\n\nWelcome to the No Blue Sky series! I'm Bob Mills, and I'm thrilled to introduce you to the complete five-volume Mars colonization saga.\n\nHere's the full series at a glance:\n\n📚 NO BLUE SKY SERIES (5 Volumes)\nA gripping science fiction saga following humanity's first Martian colony — the struggles, the risks, and the dream of building a new world.\n\nVol I: No Blue Sky: Built from Dust — $9.99\nThe journey begins. Earth's first Martian settlers face their greatest challenge: survival.\n\nVol II: No Blue Sky: The Oxygen Gamble — $11.99\nAs the colony grows, one desperate gamble could mean life or death for everyone.\n\nVol III: No Blue Sky: Rivers Under Mars — $11.99\nBeneath the Martian surface lies a discovery that changes everything.\n\nVol IV: No Blue Sky: The Red Charter — $12.99\nPolitics, power, and the fight for Martian independence reach a boiling point.\n\nVol V: No Blue Sky: The First Martian Nation — $14.99\nThe stunning conclusion to the saga. A new nation rises — but at what cost?\n\n🎁 Would you like to sample a chapter before buying? Just reply to this email with the title that interests you, and I'll send a free sample chapter right away.\n\nHappy reading,\nBob Mills",
